          "originalSha256": "006ba307c9e2b065af6d9fce8d2d42be494b9b2afcff4b2435075eea12ee9004",
          "excerpt": "梁開平三年十月敕："
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "huiyao-v016",
          "paragraphId": "huiyao-v016-p6",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "006ba307c9e2b065af6d9fce8d2d42be494b9b2afcff4b2435075eea12ee9004",
          "excerpt": "宜令宰臣趙光逢專判。凡出給過所，先具狀經中書點檢，判下，即本司郎中據狀出給。"
        }
      ],
      "variants": [
        {
